/// `comp_vtable::SET_UP_RULES`; negative: 0x386) and the tie tree (virtual `cup_vtable::MAP_FIXTURE_TREE`; negative:
/// 0x38d), whose eax it returns. After a box the copy returns 0 (the original the box's eax).
