/// −1 (the byte); `out` (when given) = 0, `rounds` = 6, `extra` = 0; the table (`exe::crt_malloc` of 6 × 0x68; out of
/// memory, the error box at line 0x9c and 0) with the six rounds of `IRISH_CHALLENGE_CUP_ROUNDS`
